            "type": "game",
            "name": "Super Lumi Live",
            "steam_appid": 667760,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/667760/extras/2cc38675edcd00811915b454f1730622.poster.avif?t=1775395015\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/667760/extras/2cc38675edcd00811915b454f1730622.webm?t=1775395015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/667760/extras/2cc38675edcd00811915b454f1730622.mp4?t=1775395015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Control the cute and speedy Lumi to reach the producer, Lord Leo, and escape his diabolical game show!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to play, difficult to master</h2>Simple controls with movement that's fast, fluid and precise yet deep.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >60 unique levels spread across 6 themed worlds</h2>Explore levels for tokens to unlock new paths on the map screen allowing for different ways to reach the end and beat Lord Leo.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awesomely bouncy electronic beats</h2>Tonnes of melodic electronic music tracks driving the action with beat-matched visuals.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replays and Ghosts</h2>Nuances to the movement in a game designed to not limit your mastery brings with it ways to always improve your times!  See how you rank on the leaderboards or share your best replays with the world!<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level/world editors</h2>Create and share your own devilish levels and worlds via the Steam Workshop with fully integrated editors.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desert Dimensions extra campaign now available</h2>Over 20 extra levels filled with new mechanics and challenges calling you to explore the desert to find the tomb and conquer the Pyramid of Geezer.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/667760/extras/2cc38675edcd00811915b454f1730622.poster.avif?t=1775395015\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/667760/extras/2cc38675edcd00811915b454f1730622.webm?t=1775395015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/667760/extras/2cc38675edcd00811915b454f1730622.mp4?t=1775395015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Control the cute and speedy Lumi to reach the producer, Lord Leo, and escape his diabolical game show!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to play, difficult to master</h2>Simple controls with movement that's fast, fluid and precise yet deep.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >60 unique levels spread across 6 themed worlds</h2>Explore levels for tokens to unlock new paths on the map screen allowing for different ways to reach the end and beat Lord Leo.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awesomely bouncy electronic beats</h2>Tonnes of melodic electronic music tracks driving the action with beat-matched visuals.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replays and Ghosts</h2>Nuances to the movement in a game designed to not limit your mastery brings with it ways to always improve your times!  See how you rank on the leaderboards or share your best replays with the world!<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level/world editors</h2>Create and share your own devilish levels and worlds via the Steam Workshop with fully integrated editors.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desert Dimensions extra campaign now available</h2>Over 20 extra levels filled with new mechanics and challenges calling you to explore the desert to find the tomb and conquer the Pyramid of Geezer.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "A 2D platformer that focuses on tight movement, careful exploration and going fast! Every level has been meticulously crafted to make exploring and speeding as fun as possible with many deep level mechanics. It might not look like much but this hard yet fair platformer feels like no other.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês",
