                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Super Lumi Live is an absolute joy of a speed-focused precision platformer. You can go as deep as you want with this one. There are layers upon layers to these levels: regular completion with checkpoints, completion with all collectables, completion with all collectables and no checkpoints, 3-star speedrun ranks, [spoiler]S rank speedruns[/spoiler], the list goes on and on. Don't think twice if you dig highly challenging platformers. This is one of the best out there. \r\n\r\nThen do yourself a favor and play DYE if you haven't already. It's a similar game, with a bit less Sonic influence, that is ridiculously slept on.",
